    /// the one program on now: the server picks its file for this device
    /// as startPlayback does, the stream's positionMs is the live
    /// position, where the client starts, and the client offers no pause
    /// or seek. The program ends at onAir.now.endsAt, which is where its
    /// stream ends. Then the client ends the session and calls this
    /// again: the next program may start at once (always on a music
    /// station, and on a movies or tv station when one ends exactly on
    /// its boundary), or the call answers 409 off_air with resumesAt,
    /// when the client shows the station's identity image and calls
