    /// or the Watch together ends, at most 25 seconds, then answers the
    /// state as it stands; without, it answers at once. Each poll by a
    /// member marks that member present; a member unseen for 30 seconds is
    /// not present, and a Watch together none of whose members has polled
    /// for 60 seconds ends.
    ///
    /// Every play, pause and seek takes effect on both members at one
    /// instant, `effectiveAtMs`, a lead after it was sent: from then the
    /// player is at `effectivePositionMs`, advancing while `playing`. The
    /// lead is what the slowest present member needs to hear of the change
    /// and act on it, at least 0.3 second and at most 1 second; it need
    /// not be a whole second, and a client must not assume one. A member
