    /// `serverTimeMs` of a few answers without `after`, taking the one
    /// with the shortest round trip as answered at its midpoint. A change
    /// whose instant is still ahead is applied at that instant on the
    /// client's estimate of the server's clock, the sender's own player
    /// included; one already past is applied at once at the position it
    /// has run on to. While playing, a player more than 0.5 seconds from
    /// the shared position seeks to it. A member who is not in the player
    /// opens it, and starts its own playback session at the shared
